        "heading": "Designed for Homes,\nCrafted for Living.",
        "main_text": "<p>StyloDyna was created with a simple belief: every home should reflect the people who live in it. Inspired by timeless British design and contemporary Scandinavian simplicity, we curate furniture and décor that bring warmth, comfort, and refined character to everyday living.</p>",
